             and assessment are provided in this annex. Not all of the core resource inflow circularity indicators are
             necessarily applicable at each system level or every type of system. In cases where an indicator is not
             applicable, it can be counted as zero or declared as “not applicable (N/A)”, explaining why it is not applicable.
             If the relevant data are not available, they should be counted as zero.', 'derived', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
