             circular inflows from 100 %. For a material to be described as a “renewable material”, it shall adhere to the', 'derived', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
